  "bodyHash": "1e6adede036e4a27",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/1d/c9/41/1dc94136fe02dcfb8bcc07dc04f16a28.png\" alt=\"Jurassic World Reborn II 橫幅\" width=\"1124\" height=\"591\"></p>\n<p>&lrm; &lrm; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JMqZhxk7gA\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/831803522281635850?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=4a94fb&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"172\" height=\"24\"></a> &lrm; <a href=\"https://patreon.com/KnightDexx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=KnightDexx&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\" width=\"166\" height=\"24\"></a> &lrm; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fKNIGHTDEXX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Rent -a server-9cf?style=for-the-badge&logo=Codeforces&logoColor=cyan\" alt=\"租用伺服器\" width=\"139\" height=\"24\"></a> &lrm; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/dexxknight1/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/My-modpacks-red?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"專案\" width=\"132\" height=\"24\"></a> &lrm; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fdexxknight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Support me on Ko-fi&color=C0C0C0&labelColor=4a94fb&style=for-the-badge&logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\" width=\"179\" height=\"24\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmmcreviews.com%252fall%252fmodpacks%252fjurassic-world-reborn-ii%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c1ji64K.png\" alt=\"MMC 評論\" width=\"390\" height=\"65\"></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🦕 歡迎來到侏羅紀世界重生 II 🦕</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">踏入一個過去甦醒、遠古巨獸再次漫步大地世界。<strong>Jurassic World Reborn II</strong> 邀請你展開一場穿越時空的非凡探險，在這場探險中，科學與史前奇蹟交會，世界的每個角落都蘊藏著等待被發掘的新發現。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">這不僅僅是生存&mdash;而是一場<strong>史無前例的古生物探險</strong>。從遠古化石中提取 DNA，培育數百萬年未曾踏足大地的生物，並建立屬於你自己的侏羅紀庇護所。從海洋深處無聲滑行的海洋爬蟲類，到天空中壯麗翱翔的無齒翼龍，每一個生態系都成為窺探地球遙遠過去的窗口。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">但史前世界僅僅是開始。穿梭於神秘的維度，掌握強大的科技，精通奧秘魔法，並與其他探險家結盟。你將成為著名的古生物學家、敢於探索未知領域的冒險家，還是打造終極恐龍公園的遠見建築師？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">憑藉提升的視覺效果、身臨其境的環境音效以及精心打造的生態系統，在這個模組天堂中的每一刻都宛如真正的探險。遠處的火山轟鳴，瀑布穿過茂密叢林傾瀉而下，遠古生物的呼號迴盪在荒野之間。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>恐龍時代已重返人間。你準備好回應這聲召喚了嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#06c\"><strong>💻 系統需求</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>建議記憶體：</strong>配置給 Minecraft 的 16GB 至 20GB</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Java：</strong>需要 Java 17+（使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/TheUsefulLists/UsefulMods/blob/main/JavaArgumentsOptimization.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">最佳化 Java 參數</a> 以獲得最佳效能）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>OptiFine：</strong>❌ 與此整合包不相容（光影已透過 Oculus/Rubidium 內建）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Minecraft 版本：</strong>1.20.1 Forge</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/b4/98/40/b4984061a92d4685ff76ac6302586825.png\" alt=\"功能橫幅\" width=\"870\" height=\"126\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#c00\"><strong>🎯 侏羅紀世界重生 II 的獨特之處？</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🦖 史前生物與恐龍</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>560+ 個模組</strong> 精心挑選，打造終極侏羅紀體驗</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jurassic-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jurassic Reborn (JR)</a> - 包含<strong>108 種不同的生物</strong>，涵蓋恐龍、海洋爬蟲類、史前魚類及基因雜交種</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fossils\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fossils &amp; Archeology</a> - 超過<strong>60 種史前生物</strong>可透過考古探索復甦</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">提取 DNA、孵蛋，並培育屬於自己的史前夥伴</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">創建客製化棲息地，並觀察逼真的恐龍行為</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🌍 探索維度</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a> - 充滿神秘與遠古遺跡的魔法森林領域</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a> - 基岩下方廣闊的地下維度，擁有獨特的生態系統</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blue Skies</a> - 包含 Everbright 與 Everdawn 兩個天界領域，擁有浮空島嶼</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">還有更多充滿史前秘密與寶藏的維度等你探索！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🔍 探索與冒險</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">發掘散佈在世界各處的隱藏 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/treasure2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Treasures</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">探索神秘的迷宮與廢棄建築</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">揭開沉船與水下考古遺址的秘密</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lootr\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lootr</a> - 多人伺服器中為每位玩家提供個人化的戰利品系統</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reskillable-reimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reskillable</a> - 最多 <strong>8 項自訂技能</strong> 用於角色成長</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>✨ 魔法與神祕學</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a> - 自然魔法與法力操控</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a> - 可自訂的法術製作系統</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/psi\" rel=\"nofollow\">PSI</a> - 透過視覺程式設計實現可程式化的法術創作</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">運用魔法能量來強化你的史前探險</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>⚔️ 武器、防具與工具</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry</a> - 豐富多樣的近戰與遠程武器庫</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timeless and Classics Zero Guns</a> - 用於防衛的現代槍械</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinkers-construct\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tinkers' Construct</a> - 自訂工具鍛造與材料組合</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">抵禦兇猛的史前掠食者與競爭對手探險家的攻擊</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🏛️ 裝飾與建造</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/decocraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Decocraft</a> - 為你的基地提供數千種裝飾物品</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/engineers-decor-ported\" rel=\"nofollow\">Engineer's Decor Ported</a> - 工業風格裝飾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisel-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chisel Reborn</a> - 數百種方塊變體</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chisels &amp; Bits</a> - 微方塊建造技術，打造精緻設計</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/building-but-better\" rel=\"nofollow\">Building But Better</a> - 增強的建造選項</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bibliocraft-legacy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bibliocraft Legacy</a> - 傢俱與收納解決方案</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">打造終極恐龍公園、研究設施或史前博物館！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>💎 獨特神器與遺物</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artifacts</a> - 具備特殊能力的強力可穿戴物品</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Relics</a> - 具有神祕屬性的遠古寶藏</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">揭開賦予超凡力量的傳說物品</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">組合神器，打造探險家的終極裝備配置</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>📦 收納解決方案</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2</a> - 先進的數位儲存網路</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tom's Simple Storage</a> - 易於使用的物品管理</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/storage-drawers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Storage Drawers</a> - 緊湊的大量收納</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Storage</a> - 可升級的收納容器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a> - 可升級的便攜式收納背包</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">高效整理你的化石、DNA 樣本與史前發現</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>⚙️ 科技與自動化</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> - 機械裝置與動能系統</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-foundation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermal Series</a> - 發電與礦石處理</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-io\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ender IO</a> - 導管與機器自動化</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a> - 先進機械與數位採礦</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Engineering</a> - 多格方塊機器與電線系統</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/industrial-foregoing\" rel=\"nofollow\">Industrial Foregoing</a> - 資源處理與農業自動化</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/draconic-evolution\" rel=\"nofollow\">Draconic Evolution</a> - 終局科技與能源</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/void-miners\" rel=\"nofollow\">Void Miners</a> - 自動化資源開採</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">自動化作業你的恐龍育種計畫與資源採集！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>⚡ 能源產生</strong></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extreme-reactors\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extreme Reactors</a> - 核能發電，滿足龐大能源需求</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-generators\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Generators</a> - 多燃料發電系統</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/solar-flux-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Solar Flux Reborn</a> - 潔淨太陽能</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flux-networks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flux Networks</a> - 無線能量傳輸</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">為您的研究設施與收容系統供電</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#228b22\"><strong>📊 整合包統計數據</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>560+ 個模組</strong> 精心挑選並配置</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>108 種史前生物</strong> 來自 Jurassic Reborn</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>60+ 種可復生生物</strong> 來自 Fossils &amp; Archeology</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>3 大主維度</strong> 外加下界與終界</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>8 項自訂技能</strong> 透過 Reskillable 模組</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>海量建築結構</strong> 與探索機會</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>專業級品質</strong> — 針對流暢遊玩進行最佳化</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/65/32/56/6532567a92d1b504e57aafc36700abdb.png\" alt=\"Server Hosting Banner\" width=\"870\" height=\"126\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fKNIGHTDEXX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/fd1be5c2-6afd-4000-8095-0e31ef4da735.png\" alt=\"BisectHos